0he"><div data-rid="932e3cb2-b729-4c17-89a6-51845a2c78db" class="r-1lgk1et"><div data-rid="e6944129-cece-4aa3-a564-6210d26786b7" class="r-1ecn4v2" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="273ab6dd-ccfd-413c-ac1f-e41a74b9e0dd" class="r-wyten2" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="513eb9d8-5809-4cb9-90d5-615abe5e72e0" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rlmb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-levz7w"><div data-rid="1a2cf8b7-187b-40a2-be5f-3c744a017682" class="r-1r99v5u alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What is included in the "Try-It Box"?</p></span></div><div data-rid="a9bbd419-b0ed-4231-b434-faa36cfb89c1" class="r-1od96k7"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-16qi3k9" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rlmb2:"><div data-rid="604301e5-5fe2-4870-8931-18abde2f6016" class="r-zbxp51"><div data-rid="6ab55687-7489-4ed9-a6fa-dd5c13f854cc" class="r-1khx4d1 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The "TRY-IT" Box is a 10 lb sampler of premium American beef cuts, perfect for new customers who want to experience the flavor of Freedom Farms without committing to a full share. It typically includes:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Ground Beef:</strong> 2 lbs of rich, flavorful, pasture-raised ground beef.</p></li><li><p><strong>Assorted Roasts:</strong> Approximately 3–5 lbs, which may include chuck, rump, arm, or sirloin tip.</p></li><li><p><strong>Assorted Steaks:</strong> 2 lbs of premium cuts, featuring ribeye, delmonico, chuck, skirt, or sirloin.</p></li><li><p><strong>Bonus Cuts:</strong> A random mix of stew meat, short ribs, minute steaks, burger patties, or soup bones.</p><p>Note: Some cuts may be smaller than those in our regular meat shares, and minor substitutions may occur based on inventory.</p></li></ul></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="2d58c5f9-1b7f-4a08-8c7b-50545ebd84e1" class="r-1vl9z7v" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="6d93e18a-d49d-4b02-9926-66bc1feba65f" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R15mb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-ecnj3y"><div data-rid="f3d820e1-e60b-4e22-aa67-a44a1dd297f9" class="r-uqa2qy alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is the beef in the "Try-It Box" grass-fed and pasture-raised?</p></span></div><div data-rid="28d8c5b5-5385-48b6-91f1-f27df41e44d7" class="r-nlivni"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-18dg3hx" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R15mb2:"><div data-rid="2e91c8eb-906c-45fb-a2cd-1cf1d1d6cbc2" class="r-gixjv2"><div data-rid="fba9f89f-6d53-4fdd-a940-f716de55f279" class="r-13c1tjr alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes, absolutely. All the beef in our Try-It Box comes from 100% grass-fed and pasture-raised cattle. At Freedom Farms, we practice rotational grazing, moving our cows to fresh pasture daily. This allows the cows to enjoy the most nutritious grasses, which is key to the health of the animals and the superior flavor of the beef.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="1d37d96e-5d64-4668-9193-8c8115548ca1" class="r-2f2e7h" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="3175edc5-f12f-44bc-80fa-f55d572cf53a" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R1lmb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1bt1ij7"><div data-rid="f1776120-c27c-4d85-8370-c82d61e83ff8" class="r-1ftwavu alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What is your shipping and return policy?</p></span></div><div data-rid="bb4ccc62-2779-43b9-90a8-79ce5415c4db" class="r-1nj0y9f"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1uz4x5r" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R1lmb2:"><div data-rid="6d52c597-0ec4-4003-975e-a1d24cf8ad09" class="r-1imj584"><div data-rid="e7c626fc-72b0-4778-a027-65a6aa7822aa" class="r-wrv2yp alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>We ship nationwide. All boxes are shipped frozen and vacuum-sealed to ensure maximum freshness upon arrival. When your order is ready, you will receive tracking information. Alternatively, you can choose to pick up your box directly at our farm in Greene, NY. Due to the perishable nature of our products, we do not accept returns on food items once the box has been shipped or picked up.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="1d67e43b-2261-46cb-b8c1-aafeecb23343" class="r-18xugk5" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="90b57a40-3b1a-4e4d-a158-84726e1f04f1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R25mb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-o8meds"><div data-rid="e87f8239-c6b9-4767-ae76-4df1cbefc664" class="r-abdzh9 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Why does your beef taste so good?</p></span></div><div data-rid="5ddc0389-dd22-4293-94f0-8fdef0e28990" class="r-x345d7"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-mw7s7k" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R25mb2:"><div data-rid="07c541cd-c47e-4265-a964-eb99156bd428" class="r-1ms73m5"><div data-rid="acf2a4fb-75f1-4a60-8062-eb8baf9125a3" class="r-1jrc8tk alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The rich, full flavor of our beef is a direct result of our ethical farming methods. Our cattle live a life of freedom on pasture, feeding on diverse, fresh grasses. We ensure our animals are free of added hormones and antibiotics. This commitment to animal welfare and natural diet is what produces the clean, fresh, premium taste you'll experience with our farm-raised meat.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="aeb944ae-7b35-4253-9205-448606bf1855" class="r-115r4hn" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="9285e49e-294c-42a3-907a-34a40987d13b" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R2lmb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-2i2hxm"><div data-rid="59f0d8e8-da9e-473a-ae71-d08ce3ce5e51" class="r-tprsnl alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Do you use hormones or antibiotics on your cattle?</p></span></div><div data-rid="167d1ee3-327c-47a8-8a70-01790704a635" class="r-pr4bwq"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-6ddrn3" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R2lmb2:"><div data-rid="56edc74a-cb31-4d69-b5ff-c91490d89e4d" class="r-j2elg3"><div data-rid="f13615f6-f89b-4d9e-8a7a-aabcd5a3ffd6" class="r-141i9du alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>No. All of our meats are free of added hormones and antibiotics. We are committed to raising our animals in a healthy, low-stress environment on pasture, which minimizes the need for medical intervention. Our goal is to provide you with the cleanest, freshest meat possible.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="12d09dfc-060f-4b5b-a38c-d01357f5f3c0" class="r-1v59e3l" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="2142bbe7-9cf0-40dc-ae1c-1eda2ca8b731" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R35mb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-5aocqm"><div data-rid="c5440b05-36b7-4ab5-aa13-330d561a1619" class="r-1yi77hs alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is your farm certified organic?</p></span></div><div data-rid="d042b5bb-6125-4b2d-bc4c-1e62040fb514" class="r-tfqiat"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1jmurv" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R35mb2:"><div data-rid="f201164c-6917-496b-8456-be8dba02ba2f" class="r-ksvfxu"><div data-rid="59f600bc-f20a-48a7-84a1-5a7efe711a1d" class="r-1c1f23z alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>We are not certified organic. However, we are committed to sustainable and ethical practices, going beyond industry standards for animal welfare. Our animals are 100% pasture-raised, and we do not use antibiotics or hormones. We believe our rotational grazing and commitment to a natural lifestyle for our animals provides a product quality and taste that is second to none.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div><div 